OL,3,GNEWSACommunity figures back ban on face
OL,4,Acoverings
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Baker, from Lichfield, founded a
OL,7,Fgroup against bike theft and said he
OL,8,Fhoped the new Nottingham measure,
OL,9,Ffollowing similar plans in Stafford,
OL,10,F"works its way up and down the
OL,11,Fcountry".
